# Store every file byte-for-byte as it appears in the working tree.
#
# The benchmark's vortex-parity smoke asserts that src/sim, src/render and
# public/assets are SHA-256 identical to the canonical Astra host checkout.
# Any line-ending normalisation by git turns the LF sources into CRLF on
# checkout and fails that comparison, so conversion is disabled outright.
* -text
